engine-config.json
engine_sha
*.html

# Coverage artefacts
.coverage
htmlcov/

# The run-artefact patterns above are deliberately broad, which swallowed the frozen
# scanner fixtures — tests/fixtures/scan_data.json and scan_results_golden.json were
# untracked while the suite passed locally and would have failed on a fresh clone.
# Fixtures are source, not run output.
!tests/fixtures/**
